    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:101e455cf654518cee110528",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我，一定会登上更加难以企及的高峰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "14bda6f250979611a7e8f6e8893df41ce34186397e42d22c9a7cba2baac7caca",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136205.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        48,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/48/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:883e0e8c6c9bbde9924fcc66",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "众位强者们那永无止境的『欲望』， \n正带着仿佛要将一切都焚烧殆尽的势头， \n于此时――赤红耀眼地燃烧了起来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa9a3013e5ab7c91690278ab0ba1e90821db6823f9025b6f529d3cc3bf0ba779",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136205.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        49,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/49/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0dfb7b40cdd68ca20d1d9d0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "红色梦想在历经了\n三后冠赛事的激烈交锋后，\n如今的状态正处于绝佳的巅峰。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7037157d4212740b520862df2d7ee8becfd4bb03ed346a16e91dac8a3b91176",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136205.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63fc13a5ba5bfb2ade0399ae",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "红色梦想",
      "source_fingerprint": "405c5a0b0ebadc3e73aa5cd38d97e1245d0918e4d04ce079a699041f7ad83372",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
