    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56f58dc9dca9acd06c55a68a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在此次的『日本杯』上……世人似乎都在 \n密切注视着，我以那位大人为对手 \n究竟能战到何种地步呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "62e4fa83d87ee9ebe031ceead2a2ee90ea50cc90e9134b8db9bbd4ff85843475",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136205.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
