    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a97c9c051c9738607ad8ed7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "梦之旅是负责承办远征协助的\n『远征支援委员会』的委员长，\n是一位非常礼貌、举止温和的马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cd0e51eb9b02fd287835680def15845694650d198abcf4557f81c2c69a0160f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136206.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f5fd78fe81497de8b550888",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（在多方面都才华横溢……是位杰出人物）",
      "source_fingerprint": "502db31d8b483cc688a429d22870b431c0feba25b39b88ed3ea1d488dfb6fbed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136206.json",
